  "description": "A new mobile game called Arcana Fantasy is all the rage across the globe. But here’s the game’s big secret: once a player decides to join the game, they’re unwittingly transported into a virtual world and trapped there until somebody beats the boss to clear the game. Yoon started the game to find his missing father, but now he’s in much more trouble than he bargained for. Will Yoon and his companions be able to find his father and escape from the blurred reality of this virtual imprisonment?\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)\n\n*Note: Winner of the Excellence Award in Lezhin's 4th World Comic Competition.*",
